                "headline": "Winter Weather Advisory issued November 11 at 2:25AM AKST until November 11 at 3:00PM AKST by NWS Juneau AK",
                "description": "* WHAT...Snow expected. Patchy blowing snow. Total snow accumulations\nup to 5 inches near White Pass. Winds gusting as high as 35 mph.\n\n* WHERE...Klondike Highway past milepost 10.\n\n* WHEN...Until 3 PM AKST this afternoon.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel could be very difficult to impossible.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Snow may begin as a mix, but will soon\ntransition over to accumulating snow as temperatures cool.",
                "instruction": "Slow down and use caution while traveling. For the latest road\nconditions where available call 511 or visit 511.alaska.gov.",
